WEBVTT

00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:37.840
Where am I?

00:01:39.190 --> 00:01:40.750
I can't see anything.

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:42.880
Is this fog?

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:54.280
M... om...

00:01:57.140 --> 00:01:58.490
Mom?

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:00.430
Mom!

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:02.420
Mom!

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:05.790
Mom!!

00:02:14.830 --> 00:02:16.990
I had another dream about Mom...

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:21.000
Why do I keep having this dream about her?

00:02:23.650 --> 00:02:29.630
Fallen to Hikara

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:39.540
It's not like you to oversleep and miss giving Lilan breakfast.

00:02:40.420 --> 00:02:41.690
I'm sorry.

00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:46.410
You look a little pale.  Are you not feeling well?

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:49.520
No, I'm only a little short on my sleep.

00:02:50.010 --> 00:02:50.980
Sleep-deprived?

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:55.230
Yes.  I'll make sure it won't happen again.

00:03:09.990 --> 00:03:17.790
<i>At this rate, Lilan will be able to live with humans, but it won't be able to live with wild beast-lords.</i>

00:03:17.790 --> 00:03:20.410
<i>But that's nothing you have to worry about.</i>

00:03:20.410 --> 00:03:24.330
<i>It can never return to the wild.</i>

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:48.490
Mom!

00:03:49.070 --> 00:03:50.670
Mom!!

00:03:51.530 --> 00:03:54.070
Mom!!

00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:05.330
What could be gained by doing this?

00:04:10.090 --> 00:04:14.890
<i>All right, Erin.  I'll teach you everything I know.</i>

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:17.100
Oji-san...

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:23.360
Lilan.

00:04:26.510 --> 00:04:29.960
I want to see Oji-san.

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:33.730
Do you think he'd like it if I visited him?

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:37.150
No, I'd be a bother, wouldn't I?

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:45.870
Besides, won't you be lonely if I'm not around?

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:51.470
I know.  Maybe I'll write him a letter.

00:04:53.260 --> 00:05:00.060
A letter is something that carries your feelings to someone far away!

00:05:20.650 --> 00:05:22.570
That was one heck of a fog, wasn't it?

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:23.970
It was.

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:25.970
Who knew there was a place like that in Kazalm?

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:27.450
Not me.

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:28.760
"Fog?"

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:31.750
You guys shouldn't go near that place.

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:33.160
W-Why not?

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:33.980
Why not?

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:34.000
Within that fog, a mysterious light floats around every night.
Why not?

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:39.220
Within that fog, a mysterious light floats around every night.

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:44.600
It takes away the souls of those who wander in and takes them down to Hikara.

00:05:45.310 --> 00:05:46.980
A light within the fog?

00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:53.940
H-Hikara, as in the place where bad people go to after they die?

00:05:53.940 --> 00:05:57.360
That's right.  It's a place where people like you, who have done bad deeds, go also.

00:05:57.530 --> 00:05:58.310
What did you say?!

00:05:58.310 --> 00:05:59.910
We didn't do anything bad!

00:05:59.910 --> 00:06:01.320
Don't lie to me!

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:04.040
Who are the ones always snacking?

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:06.370
Do you guys consider that a good deed?

00:06:06.370 --> 00:06:08.100
I'm sorry!
Forgive me!

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:10.100
We don't want to go to Hikara!

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:27.600
What's... that light?

00:06:28.140 --> 00:06:29.060
<i>Erin.</i>

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:31.280
Mom?!

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:42.190
There no way I'd hear Mom's voice.

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:45.940
Yet, I've come all the way here.

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:49.540
I must be... going crazy.

00:06:53.750 --> 00:06:57.840
<i>Within that fog, a mysterious light floats around every night.</i>

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:18.390
Where am I?

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:23.840
Why am I sleeping in my own room?

00:07:25.450 --> 00:07:28.660
Didn't I pass out back then?

00:07:29.930 --> 00:07:32.110
Was that another dream?

00:07:33.820 --> 00:07:35.510
I know I was there.

00:07:46.850 --> 00:07:48.870
It's an ordinary forest.

00:07:51.020 --> 00:07:53.930
It must have been a dream.

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:20.420
What are all these?

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:29.620
Could these be...

00:08:30.600 --> 00:08:31.770
beast-lords?

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:34.900
Graves?

00:08:35.770 --> 00:08:37.240
Those beast-lords statues?

00:08:37.480 --> 00:08:39.840
You never knew?

00:08:39.840 --> 00:08:40.730
No.

00:08:40.730 --> 00:08:41.230
We try to keep the students away.

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:44.900
Then Lilan will never leave Kazalm, and will stay there after death.
We try to keep the students away.

00:08:44.900 --> 00:08:46.910
So you try to keep other students away, too.
Then Lilan will never leave Kazalm, and will stay there after death.

00:08:46.910 --> 00:08:48.620
So you try to keep other students away, too.

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:58.850
Lilan can't live like a wild beast-lord.

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:06.520
Regardless of the facts that I won't give it benetrophic water or use the mute whistle.

00:09:16.850 --> 00:09:21.290
I wonder if Mom felt the same way raising Touda?

00:09:23.990 --> 00:09:27.910
That girl has come again.

00:09:27.910 --> 00:09:36.080
She must have someone who keeps bringing her back here.

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:40.250
The one who committed the crime.

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:42.160
It can't be.

00:09:42.780 --> 00:09:45.840
She let them die.

00:09:45.840 --> 00:09:49.510
How could she?

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:52.490
A serious crime.

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:59.690
It's only natural for her to be sent to Hikara.

00:09:59.690 --> 00:10:00.410
"Hikara?"

00:10:01.230 --> 00:10:07.480
Where is the wrongdoer?

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:11.220
The woman from the village of Touda breeders.

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:13.410
Yes, I know her.

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:19.710
Her name is Soyon.

00:10:19.710 --> 00:10:20.960
Mom?!

00:10:21.980 --> 00:10:25.210
Take her away.  Take her away.

00:10:25.210 --> 00:10:28.490
Take her away to Hikara.

00:10:28.490 --> 00:10:35.060
Take Soyon, the wrongdoer, away.

00:10:35.390 --> 00:10:38.730
Take her away to Hikara.

00:10:38.890 --> 00:10:43.270
Take her away to Hikara.

00:10:43.610 --> 00:10:49.990
Take her away.  Take her away.  Take her away to Hikara.

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:55.990
Take Soyon, the wrongdoer, away.

00:10:56.770 --> 00:10:59.960
Take her away to Hikara.

00:11:00.120 --> 00:11:03.720
Take her away to Hikara.

00:11:21.210 --> 00:11:22.430
Why?

00:11:23.710 --> 00:11:28.030
Why must Mom be sent to Hikara?

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:41.580
<i>Mom!!</i>

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:46.710
If only I was able to save her back then...

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:51.190
What... should I...

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:52.840
do...?

00:11:56.300 --> 00:12:00.270
Just like how I couldn't save Mom,

00:12:02.330 --> 00:12:06.480
I can't do anything for you.

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:14.360
What a surprise.

00:12:14.360 --> 00:12:17.530
This is the second time I've taken you in all covered in mud.

00:12:19.470 --> 00:12:20.710
Are you all right there?

00:12:21.290 --> 00:12:23.050
O... ji-san?

00:12:23.460 --> 00:12:24.780
Up you go.

00:12:25.410 --> 00:12:26.140
Oji-san!

00:12:26.670 --> 00:12:27.940
The fog!  The fog is-

00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:30.870
Hey now.  I won't be able to understand you if you're crying.

00:12:30.870 --> 00:12:32.120
What's wrong with the fog?

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:36.260
Mom...  Mom's in there, but the fog's in the way.

00:12:37.800 --> 00:12:40.430
There's fog between Lilan and me, too.

00:12:41.630 --> 00:12:46.620
I...  I...  I don't know what to do anymore.

00:12:47.360 --> 00:12:48.580
Erin.

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:51.530
What do you <i>want</i> to do?

00:12:54.320 --> 00:12:55.670
What do I <i>want</i> to do?

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:56.920
That's right.

00:12:57.410 --> 00:13:01.110
You put everything into what you believe in.

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:04.540
I've always respected that aspect of you.

00:13:05.790 --> 00:13:06.530
I...

00:13:08.750 --> 00:13:12.840
I... want to save Mom.

00:13:12.840 --> 00:13:16.560
And I want to raise Lilan as if it's out in the wild.

00:13:17.050 --> 00:13:20.550
I see.  Then don't hesitate, and put some effort into what you believe in.

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:25.530
After all, you kept on surprising me with how hard you work.

00:13:27.080 --> 00:13:28.490
You can do it.

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:30.470
I assure you.

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:36.900
So, what do you say I take you to where your Mom is?

00:13:37.610 --> 00:13:40.410
I was in the middle of a journey on this thing.

00:13:40.660 --> 00:13:46.870
Do you know who Jone the honey man is?

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:55.560
He lives by the river in the forest.

00:13:59.030 --> 00:14:03.530
A sexy stud that enchants even the bees.

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:03.550
But his farts stink a bit.
A sexy stud that enchants even the bees.

00:14:03.550 --> 00:14:09.900
But his farts stink a bit.

00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:15.780
Hey, ho!  Hey, ho!

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:19.100
Hey, ya, hoi.

00:14:20.820 --> 00:14:26.000
Do you know who Jone the honey man is?

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:34.710
He's a kind, and also a macho man.

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:42.520
He's got a solid heart made of steel.

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:48.850
But he's a little weak when it comes to tears.

00:14:50.850 --> 00:14:55.200
Hey, ho!  Hey, ho!

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:58.180
Hey, ya, hoi.

00:15:00.420 --> 00:15:01.630
There we go.

00:15:03.030 --> 00:15:04.440
Good luck.

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:05.900
See ya.

00:15:07.780 --> 00:15:08.740
Thank you!

00:15:11.580 --> 00:15:14.920
Thank you so much, Jone Oji-

00:15:22.040 --> 00:15:23.440
Dad!

00:15:29.060 --> 00:15:33.200
Your smile's great... no matter how many times I see it.

00:15:58.490 --> 00:15:59.370
Mom?

00:16:21.840 --> 00:16:24.950
Take her away.  Take her away.

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:27.950
Take her away to Hikara.

00:16:28.390 --> 00:16:35.000
Take Soyon, the wrongdoer, away.

00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:38.470
Take her away to Hikara.

00:16:38.920 --> 00:16:43.590
Take her away to Hikara.

00:16:43.600 --> 00:16:46.550
Take her away.  Take her away.

00:16:46.550 --> 00:16:48.860
Take her away to Hikara.

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:49.880
Don't get lost!
Take her away to Hikara.

00:16:49.880 --> 00:16:51.610
Take Soyon, the wrongdoer, away.

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:55.850
This is a dream crafted by your hesitation!
Take Soyon, the wrongdoer, away.

00:16:55.850 --> 00:16:57.190
A dream?

00:16:58.290 --> 00:16:59.770
What are you talking about?

00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:01.740
Mom?

00:17:08.990 --> 00:17:14.790
That's right.  Recently, I've only been having dreams about you.

00:17:14.790 --> 00:17:17.750
A dream about not being able to get near you because of the fog.

00:17:18.290 --> 00:17:21.670
The reason why you can't move forward isn't because you're lost in the fog.

00:17:21.670 --> 00:17:28.090
Your heart, as a result of being lost to feelings of sadness and deference, created this fog.

00:17:28.280 --> 00:17:30.590
I made this fog?

00:17:30.930 --> 00:17:34.980
Wandering through the fog is your own doing.

00:17:36.190 --> 00:17:40.040
You're using it to avoid facing your ambivalence.

00:17:40.650 --> 00:17:41.660
"My ambivalence?"

00:17:45.100 --> 00:17:46.150
This is...

00:17:48.010 --> 00:17:49.610
The Lake of Judgment.

00:17:57.170 --> 00:17:58.330
Mom!

00:17:58.330 --> 00:17:59.910
Remember, Erin!

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:06.260
All the things you've felt to this day...

00:18:07.090 --> 00:18:09.300
"Things I've felt?"

00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:50.750
Lilan.

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:12.580
I...

00:19:13.390 --> 00:19:14.270
I have to go!

00:20:14.220 --> 00:20:15.540
Lilan!

00:20:53.300 --> 00:20:54.630
Erin-chan.

00:20:54.630 --> 00:20:56.140
Little girl.

00:20:58.040 --> 00:20:59.140
Thank goodness!

00:20:59.140 --> 00:21:01.630
You wouldn't wake up no matter how much we called you, so we were worried.

00:21:02.230 --> 00:21:03.370
I'm...

00:21:05.380 --> 00:21:06.440
Lilan.

00:21:08.170 --> 00:21:10.600
I'm all right now.

00:21:12.690 --> 00:21:14.710
Sorry I made you worry.

00:21:15.230 --> 00:21:19.460
No matter what happens, I'll always be by your side, working hard.

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:22.690
It's all my fault.

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:28.420
Last night, when I was doing my night shift check, you were on the ground unconscious.

00:21:31.340 --> 00:21:35.300
You were probably startled over this lantern I was carrying.

00:21:35.720 --> 00:21:38.180
That light was from the lantern?

00:21:38.180 --> 00:21:39.300
That's right.

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:46.060
You were listening to the story I made to scare Nukku and Mokku, right?  The one about being taken away to Hikara.

00:21:46.060 --> 00:21:48.700
That's why you were frightened to the point of fainting, right?

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:50.700
Hey!  That story was made up?!

00:21:50.860 --> 00:21:54.940
Then, it was you who carried me to my room?

00:21:55.490 --> 00:22:00.510
Yeah.  There's a bog in that area, so during the summer, it gets foggy after the sun sets.

00:22:00.510 --> 00:22:03.870
There was an incident where a student fell in and nearly drowned.

00:22:03.870 --> 00:22:06.100
That's why you made up that story?!

00:22:06.100 --> 00:22:06.880
You're horrible!

00:22:06.880 --> 00:22:08.850
It's better than falling in the bog, isn't it?!

00:22:08.850 --> 00:22:10.120
Do you have a problem?!

00:22:14.630 --> 00:22:26.980
Erin swore to do her best for the sake of her mother, and for Jone, who had both encouraged her in her dream.

00:24:01.860 --> 00:24:05.410
A letter suddenly arrives from Jone's son.

00:24:05.460 --> 00:24:09.710
In the letter, it simply states that Jone has died.

00:24:10.420 --> 00:24:16.470
Everyone in Kazalm feels that there is a big void in Erin's heart.

00:24:17.260 --> 00:24:21.510
I take Erin to a place where I had
spent some time with Jone.

00:24:22.110 --> 00:24:25.090
Kemono no Souja Erin.  Death of Jone.

00:24:25.130 --> 00:24:30.070
Death of Jone
